      <h3 id="ref-datavolume-blank-fields_virt-import-dv-vms" class="group scroll-mt-20">Blank source<a href="#ref-datavolume-blank-fields_virt-import-dv-vms" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>The <code>source.blank</code> source type creates an empty disk with no data. This source type has no configurable fields.</p>
      <h3 id="ref-datavolume-pvc-fields_virt-import-dv-vms" class="group scroll-mt-20">PVC source fields<a href="#ref-datavolume-pvc-fields_virt-import-dv-vms" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
